  {
    "code": "Declaration-COPY",
    "pluginCode": "checkbox",
    "title": "Declaration",
    "isRequired": true,
    "helpText": "I confirm and declare that:\n\n-  I, the undersigned hereby certify and declare that all the information in this application and accompanying documentation is correct, complete, and true to the best of my knowledge.\n\n-  I, the undersigned hereby take full responsibility on the quality, safety, and efficacy, of the listed medicinal product over its lifetime and will ensure that each individual batch imported complies with laws in force in the Kingdom of Tonga. If required, I will cooperate with any official of the Tonga Ministry of Health in performing inspection.\n\n\n- I, the undersigned hereby confirm and agree that listing of this application for Inclusion into the Register of Medicinal Drugs does not constitute to a marketing authorisation or registration of the medicinal product in Tonga.\n\n-  I, the undersigned hereby confirm and agree to furnish the Tonga Ministry of Health with registration information as required in respect to an authorised medicinal product within such time as is stipulated in the communication.\n\n-  I, the undersigned hereby acknowledge that if the required information requested by the Tonga Ministry of Health is without valid reasons submitted the medicinal product shall be delisted from the Register of Medicinal Drugs.\n\n- I, the undersigned hereby confirm and agree that Tonga Ministry of Health shall have the authority to suspend or cancel the Medicinal Drug Registration if the medicinal product is found not to have not complied with laws in force in the Kingdom of Tonga.\n\n- I also agree to follow the Tongan legal requirements related to listing of medicinal products.\n\n- I also consent to the processing of information provided to the Tonga Ministry of Health.",
    "options": ["I agree"]
  }
]
